1	#!/usr/bin/env node
2	// The sheepdog pack's fleet-FIT sweep — the fourth cross-repo question.
3	//
4	// The census asks "is this repo a MEMBER". Freshness asks "is that membership still
5	// MEANING anything". Both take the member's declared pack set as given. Neither ever
6	// asks whether that set still MATCHES the repo — and nothing else does either: a
7	// pack's `detect` fingerprint is consulted once, at bootstrap's `--init`, and never
8	// again. Baselining backfills the seeded packs and each declared pack's `requires`
9	// closure; it does not re-fingerprint. So a repo that grows into a pack after
10	// adoption — adds a package.json, a firebase.json, a Chrome manifest — is never told
11	// the pack exists, and the owner has to already know what to ask for.
12	//
13	// This sweep is that re-ask, from the outside, weekly: for every covered member, run
14	// each canon pack's fingerprint against the member's tree over REST, and converge one
15	// `fleet-fit` ISSUE per member listing the packs its shape suspects and its
16	// declaration does not carry.
17	//
18	// It is a SUSPICION, and the issue says so. The `pack-declaration` conformance check
19	// was deliberately retired (engine/checks/README.md) because declaring a pack is the
20	// project's call; a fit finding is the same claim in a weaker place — a
21	// recommendation an owner (or the agent stage) acts on, never an assertion the repo
22	// is wrong. The agent stage that follows this sweep is what turns an accepted
23	// suspicion into a reviewed PR on the member, via the adopt-pack skill.
24	//
25	// The whole feature lives in this task folder — the fingerprint half
26	// (fingerprint-fit.mjs, pack-agnostic and fleet-blind) beside the aggregation half
27	// (this file), because nothing outside this task uses either.
28	//
29	// Dependency-free (global fetch, Node 20+); read-only toward every member, and writes
30	// only the fit issues + label in the home repo.
31	
32	import { appendFileSync } from 'node:fs';
33	import { pathToFileURL } from 'node:url';
34	import { makeGh, paged, readDeclaration, isDormant, ensureLabel, labeledIssues } from '../../fleet-api.mjs';
35	import { parseSheepdogConfig } from '../../fleet-config.mjs';
36	import { undeclaredFits } from './fingerprint-fit.mjs';
37	import { fetchTree, makeRemoteEvaluator } from './remote-context.mjs';
38	import { loadCanonPacks } from './canon-packs.mjs';
39	
40	const LABEL = 'fleet-fit';
41	const fitTitle = (fullName) => `Pack fit: ${fullName} may want packs it does not declare`;
